##1. Objective
Day 3 establishes a master delivery tracking process for the four software projects. It records current completion, estimated remaining effort, milestone sequence, dependencies, delivery risks, recovery actions, and escalation thresholds.
The assessment does not provide confirmed start dates, milestone dates, task-level estimates, or contractual deadlines. All effort estimates and relative target windows below are planning assumptions, not confirmed commitments.

