##5. Remaining Effort Estimation Approach
Use task-level estimation rather than converting remaining percentage directly into days.

Formula: Estimated remaining effort = Sum of estimated hours for all incomplete tasks

For each task, record its deliverable, development or QA hours, owner, dependency, estimate confidence (High / Medium / Low), actual hours and updated remaining estimate. Initial figures in the tracker are provisional and must be confirmed by technical owners.

